{"id":"5B","title":"Husband's Duties & Responsibilities","part":{"n":5,"title":"Marriage and Divorce"},"url":"/law/05-marriage-and-divorce/5b","entries":[{"id":"5B.1","text":"Husbands are to have authority over their wives.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":3,"verses":"16"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":11,"verses":"3,7-9"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"23"}],"citation":"Gen. 3:16; 1 Cor. 11:3, 7-9; Eph. 5:23."},{"id":"5B.2","text":"A husband is to live with his wife in an understanding way, and give honor and respect to her.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"1 Pet. 3:7."},{"id":"5B.3","text":"Husbands are to love their wives and be not bitter against them.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"25,28-33"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Eph. 5:25, 28- 33; Col. 3:19."},{"id":"5B.4","text":"A husband is to be faithful to his wife.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":5,"verses":"18-20"},{"book":"Malachi","chapter":2,"verses":"14-15"}],"citation":"Prov. 5:18-20; Mal. 2:14-15."},{"id":"5B.5","text":"Husbands are to be satisfied with their wives.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":5,"verses":"18-19"}],"citation":"Prov. 5:18-19."},{"id":"5B.6","text":"Let the husband render to his wife due benevolence or affection.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":7,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 7:3."},{"id":"5B.7","text":"Husband to provide for the family.","refs":[{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":5,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"1 Tim. 5:8."}]}